cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "elementary-transformer"
abstract: >-
  Generation of pairs of finite relational structures labelled by equivalence
  in the k-variable fragment of first-order logic with bounded quantifier rank,
  with exact Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse game solving, extraction of distinguishing
  formulas and their independent verification.
authors:
  - family-names: "Vasquez Morales"
    given-names: "Haniel Ulises"
    alias: "HanielUlises"
    website: "https://github.com/HanielUlises"
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - finite model theory
  - Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse games
  - Weisfeiler-Leman
  - first-order logic
  - transformers
